/v1/","context":{"app_id":4159350,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4159350-1847286114037576","game_id":"steam-4159350","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Bug Fixes","summary":"Hello!While monitoring the game during Steam Next Fest, we discovered several bugs and have fixed them as follows.1. Fixed the companion EAT button bugFixed a bug that prevented the EAT button from becoming available for companions during spaceship exploration.EAT is a feature that makes your companions stronger, helping you explore the spaceship more easily.2. Fixed the Mother Bug battle bugFixed a bug that prevented battles against the Mother Bug, an enemy encountered during spaceship explorat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T18:34:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037576","verified_at":"2026-10-23T23:30:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4159350-1846018067928301","game_id":"steam-4159350","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest Participation & Release Date Change","summary":"To everyone waiting for the release of A Dog’s Dream,- A Dog’s Dream will participate in Steam Next Fest with a brand-new demo based on the final version of the game.During Steam Next Fest, you’ll be able to experience significantly more content than in the previous demo.Discover new dreams, new adventures, and stories we have never revealed before!This demo will no longer be available once the full game is released.- The release date of A Dog’s Dream is changing.Throughout Steam Next Fest, we w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T04:26:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928301","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4159350-1844751498220431","game_id":"steam-4159350","kind":"update","title":"September 22 Update Issues Fixed","summary":"Hello,We discovered several issues in the September 22 update and have released a hotfix.The following issues have been fixed:-An issue where, when attempting to explore the spaceship, a message stating that Cloud was exhausted would appear regardless of whether the required conditions were met, preventing exploration from starting.-An issue where the dialogue with the Dreambug Bird monster during exploration would not progress correctly.As the beginning of the current demo has also been changed","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T06:44:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498220431","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4159350-1844115010502013","game_id":"steam-4159350","kind":"update","title":"A Dog's Dream — Out of the Box Selection & Demo Update","summary":"We're incredibly happy to share that A Dog's Dream has been selected for Out of the Box!Hosted by COVEN, Out of the Box is a Steam event featuring games that break the mold in all kinds of ways — from genre and gameplay to art style and beyond.Alongside A Dog's Dream, you'll find plenty of strange, creative, and fascinating games there. Go take a look!Official Event Page https://store.steampowered.com/curator/46192764/sale/OUTOFTHEBOXGAMESWe also prepared a demo update for the event!The demo has","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T17:04:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010502013","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4159350-1834602721186624","game_id":"steam-4159350","kind":"update","title":"a DOG's DREAM Release Date Update","summary":"Announcement Regarding the Release Date UpdateHello, this is PUMPKIM.The release date for a DOG's DREAM has been changed from July 31 to October 29, 2026.Fortunately, our team has recently gained enough financial room to continue development for about three more months.Because of this, we have decided to delay the release, although reluctantly, so that we can include everything we originally wanted to put into the game.To everyone who has been waiting, we are truly sorry.This was not an easy dec","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T05:56:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721186624","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4159350-1832065502818152","game_id":"steam-4159350","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Update — Bug Fix 0.23","summary":"Demo Ver. Bug Fix 0.231. The clock has been removed and replaced with scissors.We felt the clock mechanic did not fit the progression of the game, so it has been replaced with scissors.The wrong-answer penalty has also been adjusted.Previously, each wrong answer would immediately send the player to \"Limbo.\" Now, players will only fall into Limbo after 3 wrong answers.2. Revisited dreams now contain small changes.When replaying a dream you've already experienced, some dialogue and artwork may app","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-09T19:39:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502818152","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4159350-1831432155568384","game_id":"steam-4159350","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes","summary":"Hello,We’ve made several updates to the demo.1. Changes to the early sectionThe “Dr. Sea Camel” episode is no longer included in the demo. It has been moved to a later part of the game. Instead, the spaceship escape sequence has been placed at the beginning to better emphasize the main objective.New areas have been added that were not accessible in the previous version of the demo.2. Demo ending adjustedThe demo now ends after the second cutscene.In the next patch, we plan to improve overall pol","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-30T14:28:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155568384","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4159350-1830163047254195","game_id":"steam-4159350","kind":"announcement","title":"a DOG’s DREAM — Ending Theme Composition Contest","summary":"Hello,We are currently planning to create the ending theme of a DOG’s DREAM, which will carry the final emotion and lingering feeling of the game, through a selection process involving multiple musicians from around the world. This project will be carried out using the LEMONATION system by Lemon Sound (Lemon Sound), an IP-based music collaboration platform.https://www.lemonsound.co/lemonation/4-jbq4wj8nSubmission Period April 15, 12:00 AM – May 15, 11:59 PM We will carefully listen to and review","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-15T08:37:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047254195","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4159350-1828894815558349","game_id":"steam-4159350","kind":"announcement","title":"'a Dog’s Dream' Selected for INDIE Live Expo 2026","summary":"I’m excited to share that a Dog’s Dream has been selected for INDIE Live Expo 2026.4.25 (INDIE Waves)!It’s a strange and quiet dream of an old dog, and it will be featured during the live broadcast. You’ll be able to catch a small glimpse of the game alongside many other indie titles.Watch the live stream:If you’re interested, please consider adding the game to your wishlist — it really helps me a lot.Thank you so much for your support.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-02T18:24:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815558349","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4159350-1824644522844509","game_id":"steam-4159350","kind":"update","title":"Demo Coming in April – Development Update","summary":"Hello, everyone waiting for “a DOG*s DREAM.” The two of us are working hard on the game right now. We’re planning to release a demo in April, and you’ll be able to play the full game in June. We’ve been working hard to build up our wishlist count—it's already reached 600, and we’re truly happy and grateful. Recently, we updated the game trailer and created a settings menu for the demo. We hope it gives you a slightly unique vibe. It feels like it’s going to be a fun adventure. Thank you, as alwa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-16T03:33:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522844509","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4159350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:47:22Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:47:22Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4159350":"2026-1